Each third-party library follows its own license.

## Requirements

- Node.js 20 LTS or newer
- npm or pnpm
- MySQL or MariaDB
- SMTP email account for OTP / forgot password
- SPK service API running separately

## Main Features

- JWT authentication
- Role-based access control
- Password hashing with bcrypt
- School verification
- Student profile management
- Teacher management
- Excel import for student scores
- Excel template export
- Roadmap master management
- Student roadmap progress
- Guru BK guidance notes
- Integration with SPK recommendation service

